            "detailed_description": "ACIDPUNK will immerse you deep into the dystopian metropolis of Doll City .<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEmbark on a VR journey like no other into a dark and psychedelic cyberpunk universe. Solve puzzles and fight your way through an hostile city and penetrate impossible cyberspace sceneries. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nExperience vibrant and trippy visuals inspired by Metal Hurlant or Ghost in The Shell. Bang your head to a carefuly crafted soundtrack taking its inspiration from synthwave, progressive &amp; psychedelic rock as well as early electronic music classics.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou will be accompanied in your quest for truth by a mysterious entity, who will guide you in this strange place, from creepy dark alleys to unreal and breathtaking landscapes.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWelcome to the razor's edge, in the madness of a waking nightmare, where drugs slowly grind away the last hopes of the city and its inhabitants, men or machines. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nWelcome to Doll City, welcome to ACIDPUNK!",
            "about_the_game": "ACIDPUNK will immerse you deep into the dystopian metropolis of Doll City .<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEmbark on a VR journey like no other into a dark and psychedelic cyberpunk universe. Solve puzzles and fight your way through an hostile city and penetrate impossible cyberspace sceneries. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nExperience vibrant and trippy visuals inspired by Metal Hurlant or Ghost in The Shell. Bang your head to a carefuly crafted soundtrack taking its inspiration from synthwave, progressive &amp; psychedelic rock as well as early electronic music classics.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou will be accompanied in your quest for truth by a mysterious entity, who will guide you in this strange place, from creepy dark alleys to unreal and breathtaking landscapes.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWelcome to the razor's edge, in the madness of a waking nightmare, where drugs slowly grind away the last hopes of the city and its inhabitants, men or machines. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nWelcome to Doll City, welcome to ACIDPUNK!",
            "short_description": "ACIDPUNK will immerse you deep into the dystopian metropolis of Doll City . Embark on a VR journey to a dark and psychedelic cyberpunk universe. Experience vibrant and trippy visuals while listening to a carefuly crafted soundtrack taking its inspiration from synthwave and psychedelic rock classics.",
